# /etc/goblin-ledger/collector.env (mode 0640, owner root, group goblin). Never commit the real file.
# The "Goldline Forever" Battle.net client (the same values as the GitHub secrets BNET_CLIENT_ID and BNET_CLIENT_SECRET).
BNET_CLIENT_ID=
BNET_CLIENT_SECRET=
# A fine-grained GitHub token for kevincaron28/Trading-Wow only, permission "Contents: Read and write", to push the
# data branch. Give it an expiry date and note it in your calendar.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
# Optional: Cloudflare R2 copy of the data (docs/R2_DATA.md). All four, or none.
#R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
#R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
#R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
#R2_BUCKET=goblin-ledger-data
# Optional: collect from another branch of the collector code (default main).
#GOBLIN_APP_REF=main
# Optional: the daily, weekly and monthly recaps on Discord (docs/COLLECTOR_VM.md, "Discord recaps"). 1 = after each
# run, start GitHub's "Post recap" workflow for a new recap (it renders the pages and posts; the webhook and the AI key
# are GitHub secrets, not set here). Uses GITHUB_TOKEN above (Contents: read and write), or RECAP_DISPATCH_TOKEN.
#DISCORD_RECAP_DISPATCH=1
# Auction houses to post, comma separated (113 = PvP Horde).
#DISCORD_RECAP_HOUSES=113
